WEBVTT

00:00:21.020 --> 00:00:22.650
Good afternoon, everyone.

00:00:22.650 --> 00:00:25.350
On today's Glaris' Ragnarok course,

00:00:25.350 --> 00:00:27.760
we will cover Geffen's...

00:00:27.760 --> 00:00:31.390
...s-e-c-r-e-t...

00:00:31.390 --> 00:00:32.460
Let's begin...

00:00:32.460 --> 00:00:34.700
At one time, the magical city of Geffenia

00:00:34.700 --> 00:00:38.130
was located in this Geffenia Basin,

00:00:38.130 --> 00:00:41.370
But, one day...

00:00:50.910 --> 00:00:54.250
A sudden, earth-shattering bolt of lightning

00:00:54.250 --> 00:00:56.520
reduced the city of
Geffenia to rubble.

00:00:56.520 --> 00:00:57.710
Question!

00:00:59.320 --> 00:01:02.290
Why was the city of
Geffenia destroyed?

00:01:02.290 --> 00:01:04.990
A very good question.

00:01:06.190 --> 00:01:11.270
Unfortunately, 'til this day, the reason is unknown.

00:01:11.270 --> 00:01:16.840
However... the magicians regretted their past mistakes

00:01:16.840 --> 00:01:20.940
and are believed to have built a new city.

00:01:20.940 --> 00:01:24.680
This magical city of Geffen.

00:01:24.680 --> 00:01:30.190
Even to this day, there are rumors that vexed souls from the past- nightmares

00:01:30.190 --> 00:01:34.020
and doppelgangers still inhabit the underground.

00:01:34.020 --> 00:01:38.130
Everyone, please exercise due caution in your adventures...

00:01:38.130 --> 00:01:39.890
--Good day.
--Bye-bye!

00:01:40.360 --> 00:01:42.800
<i>We are the stars</i>

00:01:42.800 --> 00:01:46.770
<i>We dash across the skies</i>

00:01:46.770 --> 00:01:49.270
<i>You are my star</i>

00:01:49.270 --> 00:01:53.780
<i>A priceless love</i>

00:01:53.780 --> 00:01:59.580
<i>El Dorado,</i> <i>rising up above the dust clouds</i>

00:01:59.580 --> 00:02:03.520
<i>We are journey to the stars</i>

00:02:07.560 --> 00:02:11.630
<i>The dream I saw before I awoke</i>

00:02:11.630 --> 00:02:18.930
<i>Will surely come true, so never forget it</i>

00:02:20.400 --> 00:02:24.470
<i>Searching for a sliver in time passing by</i>

00:02:24.470 --> 00:02:31.610
<i>Where I belong, those days are over now</i>

00:02:33.110 --> 00:02:37.090
<i>Silhouettes outlining the shapes of clouds</i>

00:02:37.090 --> 00:02:39.520
<i>Farther and farther</i>

00:02:39.520 --> 00:02:46.460
<i>I want to keep looking for</i> <i>the promised land I saw in my dreams</i>

00:02:46.460 --> 00:02:48.730
<i>We are the stars</i>

00:02:48.730 --> 00:02:52.800
<i>Like a shining arrow</i>

00:02:52.800 --> 00:02:55.300
<i>You are my star</i>

00:02:55.300 --> 00:02:59.840
<i>Unfailing strength</i>

00:02:59.840 --> 00:03:05.650
<i>The panorama that spreads before us,</i> <i>beyond the darkness</i>

00:03:05.650 --> 00:03:08.550
<i>We are journey to the stars</i>

00:03:32.210 --> 00:03:34.180
Take that!

00:03:34.180 --> 00:03:35.810
You'll see, Whispers....

00:03:35.810 --> 00:03:39.010
Next time, I'll split you in two!

00:03:40.380 --> 00:03:42.010
What the-

00:03:43.220 --> 00:03:44.890
Huh?

00:03:44.890 --> 00:03:48.690
This is Yuufa's...

00:03:59.100 --> 00:04:00.370
I'm so sorry!

00:04:00.370 --> 00:04:01.770
Huh?

00:04:01.770 --> 00:04:06.140
I was going to do my laundry in the bath...

00:04:06.140 --> 00:04:09.440
...but my leg slipped.

00:04:09.440 --> 00:04:12.150
Just leave it!
I'll take care of it for you.

00:04:12.150 --> 00:04:13.950
Will you? Really?

00:04:13.950 --> 00:04:15.970
Thanks for doing it all the time.

00:04:19.890 --> 00:04:21.490
All the time, she says...

00:04:21.490 --> 00:04:22.980
Poring!

00:04:29.830 --> 00:04:33.000
It'll be nightfall soon...

00:04:34.070 --> 00:04:36.840
I told ya it wasn't gonna happen.

00:04:36.840 --> 00:04:38.510
Ya stayed in Orc Village 'til the afternoon

00:04:38.510 --> 00:04:42.340
and then ya wanted to rush to Geffen...

00:04:42.340 --> 00:04:44.180
And what's that thing?

00:04:44.180 --> 00:04:49.350
The red cloth ya picked up by the river?

00:04:49.350 --> 00:04:52.680
Ya started runnin' soon as ya picked it up.

00:04:53.960 --> 00:04:57.690
What's the big idea?!
Say somethin' if ya gonna stop!

00:05:02.330 --> 00:05:05.460
Hey Iruga! Are you listenin'?!

00:05:12.970 --> 00:05:15.140
Thank you, Roan.

00:05:15.140 --> 00:05:17.640
Don't mention it.

00:05:25.420 --> 00:05:28.560
W-Wh-Why aren't you dressed?!

00:05:28.560 --> 00:05:32.190
I just came out of the bath.

00:05:32.190 --> 00:05:34.930
Ah... the breeze feels so nice...

00:05:34.930 --> 00:05:38.990
Never mind the wind!
Hurry up and put on your clothes!

00:05:40.670 --> 00:05:43.000
Where're ya goin' today?

00:05:44.010 --> 00:05:45.940
What's with you?!

00:05:45.940 --> 00:05:47.680
I was hopin' to sleep in a nice fluffy bed tonight...

00:05:47.680 --> 00:05:50.340
...for the first time in so long!

00:06:12.700 --> 00:06:13.960
Come in.

00:06:15.140 --> 00:06:17.070
How are you feeling?

00:06:17.070 --> 00:06:21.010
Much better, thanks to you.

00:06:21.010 --> 00:06:24.380
I can go with you inside
Geffen Dungeon tonight.

00:06:24.380 --> 00:06:25.950
I'm glad to hear that!

00:06:25.950 --> 00:06:28.520
Oh, this is something
I made myself...

00:06:28.520 --> 00:06:31.680
It's very healthy, so please eat it.

00:06:38.790 --> 00:06:42.490
Thank you... I'll have it later.

00:06:47.500 --> 00:06:51.510
What is your reason for entering
Geffen Dungeon, Takius?

00:06:51.510 --> 00:06:52.810
It is my mission.

00:06:52.810 --> 00:06:53.980
Huh?

00:06:53.980 --> 00:06:59.280
I have a goal of bringing peace and stability to this world.

00:06:59.280 --> 00:07:01.020
Oh...

00:07:01.020 --> 00:07:04.280
It is my mission.

00:07:28.880 --> 00:07:32.310
Poring... Poring. Poring.

00:07:58.240 --> 00:07:59.170
Let's go.

00:07:59.170 --> 00:08:00.660
Right.

00:08:07.880 --> 00:08:10.380
I knew you'd come.

00:08:10.380 --> 00:08:13.620
I have a noble mission.

00:08:13.620 --> 00:08:15.790
Unlike people like you,

00:08:15.790 --> 00:08:21.060
I have a mission to help others, not just myself.

00:08:21.060 --> 00:08:24.830
Hmm... Okay, good luck.

00:08:24.830 --> 00:08:27.540
One-two, one-two...

00:08:27.540 --> 00:08:31.630
Hut-two-three-four...

00:08:36.980 --> 00:08:42.820
One-two, one-two...

00:08:49.620 --> 00:08:50.990
Huh?

00:09:15.680 --> 00:09:18.950
Frost... Diver!

00:09:39.210 --> 00:09:40.300
Careful!

00:09:48.220 --> 00:09:50.320
Yuufa, use your Ruafu!

00:09:50.320 --> 00:09:51.550
Huh?

00:09:51.550 --> 00:09:52.650
Right!

00:09:54.190 --> 00:09:55.990
Ruafu!

00:10:06.670 --> 00:10:08.330
Lightning...

00:10:12.240 --> 00:10:13.670
...Bolt!

00:10:21.080 --> 00:10:23.680
Got it! It's mine!

00:10:32.030 --> 00:10:35.020
We're in unknown territory from here on in...

00:10:38.430 --> 00:10:40.530
Are there any really rare items around?

00:10:41.600 --> 00:10:43.040
B-B-Boo!

00:10:44.070 --> 00:10:45.370
Stop! Don't run!

00:10:47.110 --> 00:10:49.040
Please! Stop!

00:10:50.040 --> 00:10:51.410
Hey! Come back here!

00:10:51.410 --> 00:10:53.380
Maaya-<i>chan</i>! Roan!

00:10:53.380 --> 00:10:55.580
We mustn't get separated!

00:10:55.580 --> 00:10:58.690
Just a moment, miss! Please stop!

00:10:58.690 --> 00:10:59.420
Maaya-<i>chan</i>!

00:10:59.420 --> 00:11:00.990
Calm down!

00:11:00.990 --> 00:11:01.820
Nooo!

00:11:01.820 --> 00:11:04.050
Miss!

00:11:08.400 --> 00:11:09.800
My beloved!

00:11:09.800 --> 00:11:11.830
Stop this!

00:11:11.830 --> 00:11:12.990
Huh?

00:11:14.940 --> 00:11:18.670
I love you! You love me!

00:11:18.670 --> 00:11:21.140
I need you! I want you!

00:11:21.140 --> 00:11:24.010
Yuufa, accelerate him!

00:11:24.010 --> 00:11:25.000
Right!

00:11:32.420 --> 00:11:37.360
Arghh! Life is... so short!

00:11:40.700 --> 00:11:45.630
Roan... where are we?

00:11:45.630 --> 00:11:48.270
This is Geffenia.

00:11:48.270 --> 00:11:51.710
And that is the gate where the spirits sleep.

00:12:27.640 --> 00:12:30.850
What is this gate?

00:12:30.850 --> 00:12:32.680
It's creepy...

00:12:40.960 --> 00:12:44.020
Poring... Poring...

00:12:58.370 --> 00:12:59.700
Roan!

00:13:43.720 --> 00:13:45.250
What in the world is that?!

00:13:45.250 --> 00:13:47.020
A Nightmare!

00:13:50.220 --> 00:13:54.330
What is this? What happened?

00:13:54.330 --> 00:13:56.020
Where'd everybody go?

00:13:58.970 --> 00:14:00.030
Who's there?!

00:14:08.540 --> 00:14:12.640
Huh?! You're... me?

00:14:22.220 --> 00:14:23.660
Takius-<i>san</i>!

00:14:25.490 --> 00:14:27.330
What's with that horse?!

00:14:27.330 --> 00:14:29.490
Seems a bit dangerous...

00:14:33.070 --> 00:14:34.660
Heal!

00:14:39.040 --> 00:14:41.080
Are you all right?

00:14:41.080 --> 00:14:44.670
Y-Yes... excuse me...

00:14:48.450 --> 00:14:50.010
Cold Bolt!

00:14:54.360 --> 00:14:55.090
Now's our chance!

00:14:55.090 --> 00:14:56.020
Right!

00:14:56.720 --> 00:15:02.730
Is this what the spirits really are?

00:15:02.730 --> 00:15:07.630
It can't be... what is this guy?!

00:15:10.300 --> 00:15:12.970
Come on! Attack me!

00:15:15.740 --> 00:15:17.970
If you won't, I will!

00:15:33.260 --> 00:15:34.660
Darn you!

00:15:38.400 --> 00:15:39.660
Bastard!

00:15:45.210 --> 00:15:48.330
You bastard! Bastard! Bastard!

00:16:03.890 --> 00:16:07.230
Why... Why is it I can't...

00:16:07.230 --> 00:16:10.700
He's exactly the same as me, so why?

00:16:10.700 --> 00:16:12.930
Why only me?

00:16:12.930 --> 00:16:15.300
Even though I acquired a new power?

00:16:17.000 --> 00:16:21.110
Is that the best you can do?

00:16:21.110 --> 00:16:24.580
Is that your true strength?

00:16:24.580 --> 00:16:25.640
Huh?!

00:16:42.160 --> 00:16:45.330
Frost... Diver!

00:16:50.900 --> 00:16:52.000
Oops!

00:16:55.210 --> 00:16:56.340
Maaya-<i>chan</i>!

00:17:03.820 --> 00:17:05.050
What's the matter?

00:17:05.050 --> 00:17:07.190
Are you quitting already?

00:17:07.190 --> 00:17:08.460
Shut up!

00:17:08.460 --> 00:17:11.290
Is that all the strength you have?

00:17:11.290 --> 00:17:16.260
No... perhaps you never possessed the strength?

00:17:16.260 --> 00:17:17.290
What?!

00:17:20.130 --> 00:17:25.010
You've fought your way this far because of the power in your sword,

00:17:25.010 --> 00:17:27.040
not because of your own strength.

00:17:27.040 --> 00:17:29.480
Shut up... Shut up!

00:17:29.480 --> 00:17:31.810
You have no strength...

00:17:31.810 --> 00:17:36.750
You lack the strength to protect Yuufa, or even yourself.

00:17:36.750 --> 00:17:40.750
That's... That's...

00:17:40.750 --> 00:17:42.660
...not true!

00:17:48.000 --> 00:17:51.160
I'm not going... to lose!

00:18:15.490 --> 00:18:19.990
Y-You're... Iruga-<i>san</i>!

00:18:19.990 --> 00:18:22.120
You fought well.

00:18:23.060 --> 00:18:24.960
I'll take care of the rest.

00:18:39.810 --> 00:18:41.650
A doppelganger!

00:18:44.820 --> 00:18:47.620
I'll show you how a man fights.

00:18:47.620 --> 00:18:50.960
Takius-<i>san</i>! Takius-<i>san</i>!

00:18:50.960 --> 00:18:55.330
Why? Why did she do that for me?

00:19:04.940 --> 00:19:06.570
What're ya waitin' for?!

00:19:06.570 --> 00:19:07.940
Heal her! Heal her!

00:19:07.940 --> 00:19:09.280
R-Right!

00:19:09.280 --> 00:19:10.610
Heal!

00:19:16.720 --> 00:19:18.990
What're ya restin' on the ground for?!

00:19:18.990 --> 00:19:20.990
Give me some backup!

00:19:20.990 --> 00:19:23.620
W-Who is this?!

00:19:24.990 --> 00:19:26.620
Double Strafing!

00:19:35.240 --> 00:19:36.970
Incredible...

00:19:36.970 --> 00:19:40.300
Don't just sit there like dummies!

00:19:53.590 --> 00:19:54.990
Sonic...

00:19:56.420 --> 00:19:57.650
...Blow!

00:20:28.090 --> 00:20:29.350
Lightning...

00:20:32.060 --> 00:20:34.030
...Bolt!

00:20:43.600 --> 00:20:44.740
Whaddya think?

00:20:44.740 --> 00:20:46.770
Did ya see what I did?

00:20:46.770 --> 00:20:48.840
Who are you?

00:20:48.840 --> 00:20:50.440
Who is she?

00:20:50.440 --> 00:20:52.610
Just what you saw.

00:20:52.610 --> 00:20:56.380
Oh, I'm starving!

00:21:00.520 --> 00:21:02.860
Ya wanna eat too?

00:21:02.860 --> 00:21:04.480
Yuufa!

00:21:07.090 --> 00:21:08.650
Roan!

00:21:10.330 --> 00:21:13.730
Oh Iruga, what took ya so long?

00:21:13.730 --> 00:21:15.540
I was done a long time ago.

00:21:15.540 --> 00:21:17.330
Big Brother Iruga!

00:21:19.140 --> 00:21:21.840
W-What?

00:21:21.840 --> 00:21:23.540
Oh my...

00:21:23.540 --> 00:21:27.150
Hey you! What're ya doin' with my Iruga?!

00:21:27.150 --> 00:21:28.670
I will kill you!

00:21:29.820 --> 00:21:31.350
What do you mean?

00:21:31.350 --> 00:21:35.160
Big Brother Iruga and I once formed a party a long time ago.

00:21:35.160 --> 00:21:38.290
What?! Who gives a damn about that!

00:21:38.290 --> 00:21:41.600
Get away from him or you're gonna get it!

00:21:41.600 --> 00:21:44.670
She's scary, Big Brother Iruga!

00:21:44.670 --> 00:21:46.300
Ya little tart, you!

00:21:46.300 --> 00:21:48.360
Big Brother Iruga!

00:21:50.170 --> 00:21:53.240
I want to ask you a question.

00:21:53.240 --> 00:21:57.010
Why did you save me back there?

00:21:57.010 --> 00:22:00.710
It's true that I dislike you,

00:22:00.710 --> 00:22:04.480
but that's no reason to let you be killed.

00:22:04.480 --> 00:22:07.650
I did what any human being would do.

00:22:16.330 --> 00:22:18.600
How interesting!

00:22:18.600 --> 00:22:23.000
They managed to open it and defeat those inside...

00:22:24.710 --> 00:22:26.840
Interesting...

00:22:26.840 --> 00:22:29.500
Most interesting!

00:22:34.920 --> 00:22:44.910
<i>Unable to even find a way</i> <i>to regain the strength we lost</i>

00:22:45.890 --> 00:22:54.000
<i>Here we are, beneath this vast sky</i>

00:22:54.000 --> 00:22:58.840
<i>The shining cradle of green</i>

00:22:58.840 --> 00:23:03.710
<i>Is a merry-go-round that</i> <i>will never stop turning</i>

00:23:03.710 --> 00:23:08.480
<i>Greater than any jewel</i> <i>in this world</i>

00:23:08.480 --> 00:23:12.820
<i>It is a precious treasure</i>

00:23:12.820 --> 00:23:22.820
<i>The endless journey leads</i> <i>to our tomorrow</i>

00:23:32.370 --> 00:23:34.470
<i>This is W from Kapra Service.</i>

00:23:34.470 --> 00:23:36.480
<i>Roan and the others return to Prontera.</i>

00:23:36.480 --> 00:23:38.580
<i>But something terrible happens.</i>

00:23:38.580 --> 00:23:40.480
<i>Want to know what happens?</i>
<i>Want to know?</i>

00:23:40.480 --> 00:23:43.020
<i>Next time: "What Did You Just Say?"</i>

00:23:43.020 --> 00:23:45.350
<i>See you again. Bye-bye!</i>
